<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-449] negative binomial distribution afflicted by confused conventions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-449</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There are several was that the negative binomial distribution can be defined.  Our current implementation uses all of them with predictable problems resulting.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have fairly comprehensive test cases and bug fixes that make this right.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
