                            <comment id="12892679" author="hudson" created="Tue, 27 Jul 2010 07:23:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #159 (See &lt;a href=&quot;http://hudson.zones.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/159/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://hudson.zones.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/159/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-449&quot; title=&quot;negative binomial distribution afflicted by confused conventions&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-449&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-449&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - NegativeBinomial needs fixing&lt;br/&gt;
Added test cases for NegativeBinomial and underlying integrals like incompleteBeta.&lt;br/&gt;
Added log case for Gamma.beta(alpha, beta) computation&lt;br/&gt;
Tested Gamma.gamma, Gamma.incompleteBeta, &lt;br/&gt;
Improved error messages and comments&lt;br/&gt;
Normalized variable names for Gamma distribution&lt;br/&gt;
Tested Gamma.pdf and cdf&lt;br/&gt;
Fixed confused conventions in NegativeBinomial&lt;br/&gt;
Added google guava library to dependencies&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
